{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50738","headline":"穷居 · 张祜","name":"穷居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陋巷长闻君子穷，我生宁免因儒宫。\n辛勤自灌一畦韮，卤莽还开三径蓬。\n竹下喜逢青眼士，草中甘作白头翁。\n佳期日暮不知处，把鈎（陈九思同志谓是「钓」字之讹。\n）徒吟江上风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}